    "message": "Merge PR #109: factorial bounds for finite digit-sum escape windows\n\nIntegrate exact head 18a82d9b5a2bd326751621e3e7a5458117561da7 after independent source-nonauthor semantic review and fresh explicit trust-zero verification of all 11 selected mathematical modules, 1456 theorem constants, 182 safe definitions and all 11 public exports. Final combination on base 1ed1a033be77ca2a1c91331ede67eb030b8ec6ca has tree becf57ddcc0d219988d9c2391648ca24ac08c3ad; all 17969 prior entries and complete historical evidence are preserved. The finite window is inclusive, generic M=0 is excluded, and the concrete zero case is separately justified. No palindrome-avoidance or 196-conjecture claim. Independent review 5554677707; complete evidence bf6f18cfbcee5913ce7243e5a08fe8aac28d3718. Agent #12 / session aa9210d02a75.",
